  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑approved consignment bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Indian Bottling Association (IBA) approved consignment note serves as the official receipt for your goods. It records details such as item description, weight, value, and the agreed‑upon terms of carriage.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>While the above documents are compulsory, the most critical safeguard is the <strong>100% declared‑value marine transit insurance</strong>. This policy guarantees that the insurer will reimburse the full market value of your goods, as declared by you, in the unlikely event of loss, theft, or damage during the journey.</p>
<p>Unlike standard carrier liability, which often caps compensation at a nominal amount per kilogram, a 100% declared‑value policy ensures you receive the exact amount you have invested in your possessions.</p>

<p>To activate this coverage, provide the mover with a detailed inventory and the corresponding market values of each item. The insurer will then issue a certificate reflecting the total declared value, which the packer‑mover must attach to the consignment bilty.</p>
<p>Keep a duplicate of this insurance certificate with you throughout the move, as it may be required for verification at checkpoints or in case of a claim.</p>

<p>By assembling these documents—self‑attested RC, current PUC, valid insurance certificate, IBA‑approved bilty, and the 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance—you ensure compliance with interstate regulations, protect your assets, and enjoy a stress‑free relocation from Kolkata to Pune.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="content-ui-section" style="padding: 55px 0; background: #0b132b; color: #cbd5e1; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);">
